My dad was super strict, so I rebelled.

33
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:19,203
After I ran away from home,

34
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:22,373
I started hanging out with people
who were a couple years older than me.

35
00:01:22,874 --> 00:01:24,918
Everyone was into marijuana.

36
00:01:26,044 --> 00:01:27,586
That's how it started for me.

37
00:01:27,587 --> 00:01:30,757
Some people think
I have a thing for unattractive guys.

38
00:01:31,424 --> 00:01:33,509
I've been cheated on.

39
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:37,554
This <i>Noh</i> mask and <i>Hannya</i> mask
represent a story.

40
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:40,390
It's about getting cheated on
and turning into a <i>Hannya.</i>

41
00:01:40,391 --> 00:01:42,101
I thought, "That's me."

42
00:01:42,102 --> 00:01:44,478
Plus, I'd always wanted
