92
00:03:29,584 --> 00:03:31,336
- I'm sorry.
- No, it's okay.

93
00:03:32,045 --> 00:03:34,297
- I almost went off. Seriously.
- Mmm…

94
00:03:34,839 --> 00:03:37,133
I just get so jealous
about stuff like that.

95
00:03:37,717 --> 00:03:40,469
The reason I'm this mad
is because I like him so much.

96
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:42,346
- But you're keeping it to yourself.
- Yeah.

97
00:03:42,347 --> 00:03:44,681
