100
00:03:50,355 --> 00:03:52,105
If you stay out here longer…

101
00:03:52,106 --> 00:03:54,691
- Okay.
- …it will just get awkward.

102
00:03:54,692 --> 00:03:57,570
So just hold it in for now.
Let's go back in. Okay?

103
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,364
Hmm. You good?

104
