108
00:04:07,747 --> 00:04:09,415
You probably want to avoid that.

109
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,252
- Mmm.
- I'm here for you, though.

110
00:04:13,378 --> 00:04:14,420
Let's go back.

111
00:04:17,131 --> 00:04:19,466
I think I like him too much.

112
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:22,679
So intensely that I want to cry, for real.

113
00:04:23,179 --> 00:04:24,472
It's so tough.

114
00:04:26,724 --> 00:04:28,101
Love hurts so bad.

