185
00:07:31,576 --> 00:07:32,617
LOVE DINER

186
00:07:32,618 --> 00:07:34,703
- Who cut these carrots?
- That was Maru.

187
00:07:34,704 --> 00:07:35,912
- I got it.
- Maru!

188
00:07:35,913 --> 00:07:37,581
- We making curry?
- Yeah?

189
00:07:37,582 --> 00:07:40,709
These carrots you cut are curry-sized,
stir-fry is smaller.

190
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:42,002
Can I try some?

191
00:07:42,003 --> 00:07:43,670
Hold each lengthwise and cut it like this.

192
00:07:43,671 --> 00:07:45,213
- Let me try.
- So, half?

193
00:07:45,214 --> 00:07:46,840
- No, into threes.
- Just one bite.

194
00:07:46,841 --> 00:07:48,717
- That would be three.
- Into three pieces?

195
00:07:48,718 --> 00:07:50,594
- They need to be thinner.
- Okay. Like this?

196
00:07:50,595 --> 00:07:52,137
Don't forget this one.

197
00:07:52,138 --> 00:07:53,805
- Yeah, that's it.
- Ah, got it.

198
00:07:53,806 --> 00:07:55,974
- Good job.
- I can do it if I just try.

199
00:07:55,975 --> 00:07:58,268
He's actually kind of cute, that Maru.

200
00:07:58,269 --> 00:08:00,271
He's now showing his human side.

201
00:08:02,523 --> 00:08:03,816
Honestly, I don't get it.

202
00:08:04,525 --> 00:08:08,153
I wasn't sure what that was all about,
why you walked out of the room.

203
00:08:08,154 --> 00:08:10,739
- I mean, I messed up.
- You know, I thought-- What?

204
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,450
- It was mistake.
- What do you mean?

205
00:08:13,534 --> 00:08:16,037
I wanted to apologize,
but I felt like I couldn't.

206
00:08:17,246 --> 00:08:19,290
I feel super bad about it, for real.

207
00:08:21,751 --> 00:08:23,460
I think I need to change.

208
00:08:23,461 --> 00:08:26,213
Yeah, I think that's a good idea.

209
00:08:26,214 --> 00:08:27,964
I lose my temper so easily.

210
00:08:27,965 --> 00:08:29,634
- Mmm.
- Rinrin knows what I'm like.

211
00:08:30,301 --> 00:08:33,261
But I'll try not to cry anymore.

212
00:08:33,262 --> 00:08:35,180
- It hurts.
- Yeah.

213
00:08:35,181 --> 00:08:36,891
I'm such a crybaby, I know.

214
00:08:37,683 --> 00:08:40,102
I think this school
is all about personal growth.

215
00:08:40,603 --> 00:08:43,438
- I'm still growing too.
- Do you think I can change?

216
00:08:43,439 --> 00:08:45,524
Mmm… I mean, hey, I did.

217
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:49,153
Like I said, the people I met in Part 1,
they taught me a lot.

218
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:51,572
Mmm…

219
00:08:53,157 --> 00:08:54,492
It's painful.

220
00:08:55,201 --> 00:08:58,162
- Maybe I should quit.
- Seriously. It hurts.

221
00:08:59,622 --> 00:09:01,582
I love you so much, it hurts.

222
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,751
Honestly.

223
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:07,629
It hurts so much that
I wanted to quit this school completely.

224
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,673
I see.

225
00:09:09,757 --> 00:09:13,302
Whenever I fall for someone,
I fall too hard. Seriously.

226
00:09:13,928 --> 00:09:16,513
Is Mimi someone
you're actually interested in?

227
00:09:16,514 --> 00:09:18,558
- She is.
- Do I even have a chance?

228
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:23,312
I think I want to talk to Mimi more first.

229
00:09:24,438 --> 00:09:26,314
It hurts.

230
00:09:26,315 --> 00:09:29,110
I know that I can come on
too strong sometimes.

231
00:09:31,779 --> 00:09:33,030
It hasn't changed?

232
00:09:34,282 --> 00:09:35,825
I'm still interested in her.

233
00:09:36,951 --> 00:09:39,203
I hate this.

234
00:09:42,415 --> 00:09:44,292
I hate that I'm like this.

235
00:09:49,547 --> 00:09:52,091
- Seriously.
- Should we go back?

236
00:09:54,802 --> 00:09:56,679
I'm heading back. I'm gonna go help.

237
00:10:23,706 --> 00:10:24,707
It hurts.

238
00:10:35,259 --> 00:10:37,595
I mean, am I actually
in the wrong on this?

239
00:10:39,221 --> 00:10:42,015
Seeing Sharan cry that much
honestly made me wonder

240
00:10:42,016 --> 00:10:44,518
if I should actually feel responsible
for all that.

241
00:10:45,019 --> 00:10:48,022
Like, maybe it was my fault,
maybe I did something wrong.

242
00:10:49,523 --> 00:10:52,901
I mean, I definitely liked hearing
that she likes me so much.

243
00:10:52,902 --> 00:10:55,362
But even if she keeps
feeling that way about me,

244
00:10:55,363 --> 00:10:57,156
I don't know what to do anymore.

