611
00:27:59,552 --> 00:28:00,678
- Yeah.
- Okay.

612
00:28:00,679 --> 00:28:02,555
- I'm sorry.
- No, you're fine.

613
00:28:04,599 --> 00:28:06,684
- Well, so much just happened.
- Oh, man, it sure did!

614
00:28:06,685 --> 00:28:09,269
