616
00:28:11,606 --> 00:28:14,149
So Ayacheru and Maru were talking,

617
00:28:14,150 --> 00:28:17,778
that's when she found out that Maru
was going to ask Mimi on the date.

618
00:28:17,779 --> 00:28:21,365
Still reeling from that,
she went to the smoking area,

619
00:28:21,366 --> 00:28:24,284
- then Rinrin came at her pretty hard.
