with more killer lines than rappers.

625
00:28:36,464 --> 00:28:37,381
She does.

626
00:28:37,382 --> 00:28:39,216
"To tell you straight," and "Thanksies."

627
00:28:39,217 --> 00:28:41,552
- Ayacheru is the best.
- And Mimi…

628
00:28:41,553 --> 00:28:43,887
So she made three guys in a row

629
00:28:43,888 --> 00:28:46,974
