636
00:29:05,326 --> 00:29:08,078
- But guys can't tell the difference.
- That is so true.

637
00:29:08,079 --> 00:29:10,873
I can tell that Tai-chan
doesn't really stand a chance.

638
00:29:10,874 --> 00:29:12,124
- Yeah.
- You don't think?

639
00:29:12,125 --> 00:29:14,084
I know I'm just a guy, but, yeah.

640
00:29:14,085 --> 00:29:16,754
You know, unless there's a major twist,
I actually don't think

641
00:29:16,755 --> 00:29:18,673
- he has a chance either.
- Hmm.

642
00:29:23,261 --> 00:29:25,429
- <i>There it is, the prison.</i>
- <i>Yeah, for real.</i>

643
00:29:25,430 --> 00:29:26,931
<i>That's what it looks like, right?</i>

644
00:29:29,559 --> 00:29:30,894
<i>What is he doing?</i>

645
00:29:34,564 --> 00:29:36,023
- Morning.
- Hey.

646
00:29:36,024 --> 00:29:37,150
Oh, morning.

647
00:29:38,318 --> 00:29:41,195
