655
00:30:03,468 --> 00:30:05,010
- Yes.
- We did.

656
00:30:05,011 --> 00:30:07,263
- That's what matters most.
- Right, Aya?

657
00:30:15,271 --> 00:30:18,065
<i>It's Ethics class again.</i>

658
00:30:18,066 --> 00:30:21,528
<i>Life begins when you stop running away
