1194
00:56:40,063 --> 00:56:41,648
You're going to sleep next to me?

1195
00:56:43,817 --> 00:56:44,818
Yeah.

1196
00:56:47,237 --> 00:56:48,321
Are you tired?

1197
00:56:49,155 --> 00:56:50,532
I wonder if we can sleep.

1198
00:56:51,991 --> 00:56:54,160
At this point,
I feel like it's a waste to sleep.

1199
00:56:58,581 --> 00:56:59,833
Oh, wow!

1200
